### Plugin Upload ZIP - Negative Cases

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8089
@wrongTypeFile = D:/IdeaProjects/magic-boot/plugins/magic-plugin-demo.jar
@badZipFile = D:/IdeaProjects/magic-boot/plugins/bad-plugin.zip

### TC-NEG-01 upload non-zip file when zip-only enabled
POST {{baseUrl}}/plugin/admin/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="magic-plugin-demo.jar"
Content-Type: application/java-archive

< {{wrongTypeFile}}
--WebAppBoundary--

### Expected:
### 1) code = 500
### 2) errorCode = PLUGIN_UPLOAD_INVALID_TYPE

###

### TC-NEG-02 upload broken zip (missing Manifest or checksum mismatch)
POST {{baseUrl}}/plugin/admin/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="bad-plugin.zip"
Content-Type: application/zip

< {{badZipFile}}
--WebAppBoundary--

### Expected:
### 1) code = 500
### 2) errorCode in:
###    - PLUGIN_UPLOAD_ZIP_STRUCTURE_INVALID
###    - PLUGIN_MANIFEST_INVALID
###    - PLUGIN_CHECKSUM_MISMATCH
###    - PLUGIN_SIGNATURE_INVALID
